@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness (MySQL required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### Register your own account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"researcher","password":"choose-your-own-password"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"researcher","password":"choose-your-own-password"}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Historical trends (half-open interval, no resampling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trends?asset_id=usdc-ethereum&from=2023-02-01T00:00:00Z&to=2023-02-02T00:00:00Z&interval=1m&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Imported CoinGecko daily observations (not OHLC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/market-snapshots?asset_id=coingecko.usd-coin&from=2023-03-01T00:00:00Z&to=2023-04-01T00:00:00Z&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Imported hourly candles (time is open time; source_time is close time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trends?asset_id=coingecko.a7a5&from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-02T00:00:00Z&interval=1h&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate refresh token (old access and refresh become invalid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### 网站总览（使用上方登录得到的 access token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 保存当前账号的 USDC 日快照阈值（锚定价需按币种确认）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitor/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_id":"coingecko.usd-coin","kind":"daily","source":"coingecko:market-chart","interval_seconds":86400,"anchor_price":"1","warning_bps":50,"critical_bps":100}

### 检测历史区间；将 rule_version 替换为保存规则返回的 version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitor/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_id":"coingecko.usd-coin","from":"2023-03-09T00:00:00Z","to":"2023-03-16T00:00:00Z","rule_version":"replace-with-saved-rule-version"}

### 当前账号的 USDC 阈值命中记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitor/events?asset_id=coingecko.usd-coin&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

